{% comment %}
  Step 6 — post-booking success screen, shown after "Confirm Booking" is
  tapped on the Confirmation step. No progress dots and no back button
  here on purpose (matches the Figma reference) — booking is done, there's
  nothing to go back to.

  Patient Name, Mode, and Day & Time reuse the EXACT SAME data-kal-confirm-*
  hooks as the Confirmation (review) step — renderConfirmationSummary() in
  kal-booking-flow.js already does flow.querySelectorAll() for each of
  those, so this step's matching elements get populated for free with zero
  JS changes.

  Reference No. is a static placeholder (data-kal-confirm-ref, currently
  just dashes) — becomes the real appointment ID once backend integration
  happens and an actual booking exists to reference. Payment is static
  "At the Clinic" regardless of mode, matching the "pay at reception"
  notice already shown on the Confirmation step for both modes.

  "Reschedule or cancel" is a hook (data-kal-reschedule-cancel) with no
  click handler yet — that's a separate, already-designed feature
  (localStorage token + minimal-info lookup) documented elsewhere, not
  part of this screen's build.

  The Confirmation step's "Confirm Booking" button now also carries
  data-kal-goto="booking-confirmed" (alongside its existing
  data-kal-confirm-booking hook) so the full flow is clickable through to
  this screen for demo purposes, even though nothing is actually booked
  yet on the backend.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="kal-step-booking-confirmed">

  {%- comment -%} ============ MOBILE ONLY (below 750px) ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kal-step-booking-confirmed__mobile">

    <div class="kal-confirmation-success-icon">
      <span class="kal-confirmation-success-icon__inner">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'check' -%}
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-booking-confirmed__intro">
      <h2 class="kal-step-doctor-select__heading">Appointment confirmed</h2>
      <p class="kal-step-doctor-select__subtext">A confirmation is sent to your WhatsApp number.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-confirmation-details">
      <p class="kal-confirmation-details__label">Consultation Details</p>
      <div class="kal-confirmation-details__divider"></div>
      <div class="kal-confirmation-details__rows">
        <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Reference No.</span>
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-ref>&mdash;</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Patient Name</span>
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-name>&mdash;</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Mode</span>
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-mode>&mdash;</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Day &amp; Time</span>
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-datetime>&mdash;</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Payment</span>
          <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value">At the Clinic</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-before-visit">
      <p class="kal-before-visit__label">Before your visit</p>
      <ul class="kal-before-visit__list">
        <li class="kal-before-visit__item">
          <span class="kal-before-visit__icon">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'check' -%}</span>
          <span>Pay at reception cash or card.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="kal-before-visit__item">
          <span class="kal-before-visit__icon">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'check' -%}</span>
          <span>Arrive 10 minutes early for check-in.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="kal-before-visit__item">
          <span class="kal-before-visit__icon">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'check' -%}</span>
          <span>Bring an ID and your referral letter if you have one.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <button type="button" class="kal-step-booking-confirmed__reschedule" data-kal-reschedule-cancel>
      Reschedule or cancel
    </button>

  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    ============ DESKTOP (750px and up) ============
    Reuses .kal-step-doctor-select__desktop/__panel, same as every other
    step. No progress dots, no "Before your visit" card, and no
    "Reschedule or cancel" link here — unlike mobile, this Figma export
    stops right after the Consultation Details card (confirmed in both the
    screenshot and the Copy-as-CSS dump), same kind of deliberate
    mobile/desktop content difference as Confirmation dropping its
    "pay at the clinic" notice on desktop.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__desktop">
    <div class="kal-step-entry__info">
      <div class="kal-step-entry__info-content">
        <h2 class="kal-step-entry__heading">You&rsquo;re all set</h2>
        <p class="kal-step-entry__body-text">Check the details before we hold it for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="kal-step-entry__location">
        <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--location">
          <!-- ICON: location-pin (not received yet) -->
        </span>
        <span class="kal-step-entry__location-text">
          Kerala Ayurveda Wellness Center, Kormangala &middot; Opens 8 AM
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__panel">
      <div class="kal-step-booking-confirmed__scroll">
        <div class="kal-confirmation-success-icon">
          <span class="kal-confirmation-success-icon__inner">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'check' -%}
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="kal-step-booking-confirmed__intro">
          <h2 class="kal-step-doctor-select__heading">Appointment confirmed</h2>
          <p class="kal-step-doctor-select__subtext">A confirmation is sent to your WhatsApp number.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="kal-confirmation-details">
          <p class="kal-confirmation-details__label">Consultation Details</p>
          <div class="kal-confirmation-details__divider"></div>
          <div class="kal-confirmation-details__rows">
            <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Reference No.</span>
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-ref>&mdash;</span>
            </div>
            <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Patient Name</span>
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-name>&mdash;</span>
            </div>
            <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Mode</span>
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-mode>&mdash;</span>
            </div>
            <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Day &amp; Time</span>
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-datetime>&mdash;</span>
            </div>
            <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Payment</span>
              <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value">At the Clinic</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
